Description: Tu Mundo Pet store: aquariums and premium pet products
 The Tu Mundo Pet online store (Chile) in its own window: catalogue, cart and
 checkout with Chilean payment gateways. Cart and session are kept; WhatsApp
 and social links open in the browser. Interface in Spanish.
